          "guid": "mt521g1uqf2e0gci",
          "message": {
            "text": "The animated oracle now measures the grouping intermediary and derives corrected owners: perspective owns its plane, while overflow flattening transfers ownership from the preserving host to the fresh preserving intermediary. The focused live gate passes 64/64 DPR-1/2 rows and kills 5/5 mutations; the static nested audit passes 26/26 owner rows with every vector sentinel retained.",
            "markdown": "The animated oracle now measures the grouping intermediary and derives corrected owners: perspective owns its plane, while overflow flattening transfers ownership from the preserving host to the fresh preserving intermediary. The focused live gate passes 64/64 DPR-1/2 rows and kills 5/5 mutations; the static nested audit passes 26/26 owner rows with every vector sentinel retained."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/animated-projective-frame-oracle.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 238,
                  "endLine": 252,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  const plane = direct.get(`${caseId}-plane`)!;\n  if (plane.residual <= ANIMATED_PROJECTIVE_QUAD_TOLERANCE_CSS_PX) return null;\n  // Perspective projects descendants but does not create a preserve-3d\n  // RenderingContextId. A grouping property forces the host's used\n  // transform-style flat; the preserving child then starts a fresh context.\n  if (caseId === \"perspective\") return `${caseId}-plane`;\n  if (caseId === \"grouping\") {\n    return direct.get(\"grouping-host\")!.computed.overflowX === \"visible\"\n      ? \"grouping-host\"\n      : \"grouping-middle\";\n  }\n  if (caseId === \"preserve\" && direct.get(\"preserve-host\")!.computed.transformStyle === \"preserve-3d\") {\n    return \"preserve-host\";\n  }\n  return `${caseId}-plane`;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
